WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:30.070
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:30.340 --> 01:33.578
=Against The Current=

3
01:33.579 --> 01:35.000
(Adapted from He Yanshan's novel, Orchid Fragrance Fate)

4
01:35.180 --> 01:36.920
=Episode 40= (This drama does not correspond)

5
01:36.930 --> 01:38.200
(to any real historical dynasty.)

6
01:38.210 --> 01:41.160
(The systems, culture, attire and other dynastic elements have been adapted.)

7
01:44.319 --> 01:44.799
A cricket?

8
01:44.799 --> 01:45.640
That's it?

9
01:45.879 --> 01:48.519
The Lin family's Third Young Madam

10
01:48.599 --> 01:50.560
gave the Fourth Young Lady a cricket.

11
01:50.719 --> 01:51.840
Once word gets out,

12
01:52.040 --> 01:54.439
it'll be quite the tale in Jinling City.

13
01:54.439 --> 01:55.079
Exactly.

14
01:55.080 --> 01:56.184
That's hardly a proper gift.

15
01:58.760 --> 02:00.120
I told you to prepare a dowry gift,

16
02:00.319 --> 02:02.079
and you got me a cricket?

17
02:03.079 --> 02:03.840
What's going on?

18
02:04.840 --> 02:06.640
This is no ordinary cricket.

19
02:06.640 --> 02:07.879
It's a Matou King.

20
02:07.920 --> 02:08.800
If we sold it,

21
02:08.800 --> 02:10.800
it'd fetch at least sixty gold.

22
02:12.479 --> 02:13.159
What rubbish!

23
02:13.159 --> 02:14.240
All right.

24
02:14.360 --> 02:14.919
That's enough.

25
02:15.960 --> 02:18.199
Today is Xiushu's happy day.

26
02:18.439 --> 02:19.520
Both of you, say no more.

27
02:19.520 --> 02:20.639
Say no more.

28
02:20.639 --> 02:21.400
Go on, sell it!

29
02:21.479 --> 02:22.240
Go on, sell it!

30
02:22.360 --> 02:24.439
How did I end up marrying such a useless man?

31
02:24.639 --> 02:26.120
Get me back my sixty gold!

32
02:26.130 --> 02:27.560
- You lost your post! - It's all right.

33
02:27.560 --> 02:28.460
And we have no money!

34
02:28.470 --> 02:29.879
Besides humiliating me,

35
02:30.080 --> 02:31.599
what else can you do?

36
02:32.280 --> 02:33.280
Son!

37
02:34.008 --> 02:36.630
- There are many people here. - It's all your useless father's fault.

38
02:36.639 --> 02:37.159
Let go of me!

39
02:37.159 --> 02:40.159
The Lin family claims Young Master Lin

40
02:40.240 --> 02:41.879
resigned to come home and be filial.

41
02:42.080 --> 02:43.479
Who'd be that foolish?

42
02:43.560 --> 02:45.280
Giving up a high post in the capital

43
02:45.280 --> 02:46.439
to sit idle at home?

44
02:46.840 --> 02:48.319
He must have lost His Majesty's favor

45
02:48.319 --> 02:49.919
and come slinking back.

46
02:50.120 --> 02:51.360
And this Third Young Master Lin

47
02:51.680 --> 02:53.120
never had any real ability.

48
02:53.280 --> 02:54.639
Once his backer fell,

49
02:54.639 --> 02:56.039
his colleagues pushed him out,

50
02:56.159 --> 02:57.240
and he lost his post.

51
02:58.120 --> 02:59.960
Doesn't the Lin family still have

52
02:59.960 --> 03:01.304
Marquis Yongchang as a son-in-law?

53
03:02.159 --> 03:03.520
Just look.

54
03:03.759 --> 03:05.400
With that whole string of daughters,

55
03:05.800 --> 03:08.080
the Third Young Lady is overwhelmed,

56
03:08.439 --> 03:10.120
let alone helping her own family.

57
03:10.319 --> 03:11.240
No wonder.

58
03:12.439 --> 03:13.199
I heard

59
03:14.312 --> 03:15.630
she was once in marriage talks

60
03:15.639 --> 03:18.120
with Duke Xiangguo's grandson.

61
03:18.520 --> 03:20.039
She was to marry into a duke's family,

62
03:20.719 --> 03:22.280
and then suddenly it all fell through.

63
03:22.360 --> 03:23.520
So

64
03:23.719 --> 03:25.800
Third Young Madam Lin crying now

65
03:25.960 --> 03:27.319
is rather fitting.

66
03:28.439 --> 03:29.800
What did you say?

67
03:30.680 --> 03:31.800
What about me?

68
03:32.000 --> 03:32.919
What about you?

69
03:33.240 --> 03:34.719
Come on, say that again!

70
03:34.800 --> 03:35.840
You want a fight?

71
03:35.840 --> 03:37.360
So what if I hit you?

72
03:37.520 --> 03:38.719
Mother, let go of me!

73
03:39.199 --> 03:40.000
Say it again!

74
03:40.010 --> 03:40.890
Come on, say it again!

75
03:40.900 --> 03:41.719
Say it!

76
03:41.759 --> 03:42.319
I did say it.

77
03:42.319 --> 03:43.280
What are you going to do?

78
03:43.479 --> 03:44.319
Say no more.

79
03:44.719 --> 03:45.240
Say no more.

80
03:45.319 --> 03:46.319
You want a fight?

81
03:46.319 --> 03:47.800
So what if I hit you?

82
03:47.879 --> 03:49.080
Mother, let go of me!

83
03:49.639 --> 03:50.520
Say it again!

84
03:50.520 --> 03:52.199
Come on, say it again! Say it!

85
03:52.879 --> 03:53.719
Keep going!

86
03:53.719 --> 03:54.680
You unfilial girl!

87
03:54.680 --> 03:56.159
Once a creature of the wild grass,

88
03:56.760 --> 03:58.328
I've now risen to the great hall.

89
03:59.240 --> 04:02.199
I'll never forget my wise lord's favor.

90
04:02.879 --> 04:05.840
Well fed in my jar, I stay sharp.

91
04:06.280 --> 04:09.680
Fierce in the ring, I crush the strong.

92
04:10.479 --> 04:12.599
His Majesty is fond of crickets.

93
04:13.080 --> 04:16.079
A palace eunuch, at His Majesty's order,

94
04:16.319 --> 04:19.079
wrote this poem especially for crickets,

95
04:19.120 --> 04:22.839
using them to voice lofty ambitions.

96
04:24.240 --> 04:26.079
No wonder the poem sounds so good.

97
04:26.399 --> 04:28.519
So it came from the palace.

98
04:29.839 --> 04:32.079
A fine poem.

99
04:32.160 --> 04:33.759
A fine poem indeed.

100
04:33.759 --> 04:36.600
Now Jinqiao has given me a cricket,

101
04:36.759 --> 04:39.319
surely to encourage Third Master Yang

102
04:39.519 --> 04:42.439
to honor royal favor like this cricket

103
04:42.440 --> 04:43.870
and always strive to better himself.

104
04:44.160 --> 04:45.040
With this gift,

105
04:45.600 --> 04:47.319
let's all strive for this together.

106
04:47.639 --> 04:48.439
Yes.

107
04:48.439 --> 04:50.519
- Together. - Together.

108
04:50.519 --> 04:52.319
Together.

109
04:59.879 --> 05:02.079
The Cheng family is steeped in learning,

110
05:02.439 --> 05:04.079
and you're quite literary, Fengxian.

111
05:04.120 --> 05:05.720
You must have heard this poem, right?

112
05:07.879 --> 05:09.879
Yes, I have.

113
05:10.279 --> 05:11.279
It's a fine poem.

114
05:13.680 --> 05:14.839
One more thing.

115
05:15.319 --> 05:16.839
His Majesty has sent palace eunuchs

116
05:17.000 --> 05:18.920
to collect crickets among the people.

117
05:19.160 --> 05:20.720
Any cricket chosen for tribute

118
05:20.959 --> 05:23.279
wins a hundred gold and official rank.

119
05:23.959 --> 05:24.639
Well...

120
05:24.640 --> 05:25.928
So it really is worth sixty gold.

121
05:26.120 --> 05:28.240
One cricket can win an official post?

122
05:28.720 --> 05:29.920
It's absolutely true.

123
05:31.720 --> 05:33.720
Sister Niu, if you don't believe me,

124
05:33.720 --> 05:35.240
go ask your husband.

125
05:36.160 --> 05:38.000
To curry favor with the Second Prince's

126
05:38.000 --> 05:39.279
- palace eunuchs, - I...

127
05:40.079 --> 05:41.600
he asked me just last month

128
05:41.800 --> 05:43.879
where to find a good cricket like this.

129
05:47.720 --> 05:48.639
That never happened.

130
05:59.319 --> 06:01.199
Why did she have to be a servant?

131
06:23.199 --> 06:25.240
No wonder Fengtai insisted on Lanxiang.

132
06:26.959 --> 06:28.240
In this world, a few words

133
06:28.240 --> 06:29.439
that can settle a dispute

134
06:29.639 --> 06:30.600
are rare indeed.

135
06:31.319 --> 06:32.439
But rarer still

136
06:33.000 --> 06:34.399
is claiming no credit for it.

137
06:39.160 --> 06:40.319
Because of me today,

138
06:40.879 --> 06:43.319
Xiuru and my wife were both wronged.

139
06:47.759 --> 06:50.120
No wonder those ignorant women gossip.

140
06:51.439 --> 06:52.920
But I don't understand it either.

141
06:54.160 --> 06:55.040
Why would you give up

142
06:55.040 --> 06:57.319
real power as Left Chief Commander of the Rear Military Command

143
06:58.040 --> 07:00.120
and insist on resigning to Jinling?

144
07:01.839 --> 07:04.480
Then His Majesty cut military spending,

145
07:05.079 --> 07:06.920
so there's still no real post for you,

146
07:07.959 --> 07:09.680
and you're left idle at home.

147
07:17.319 --> 07:18.319
I'm the eldest grandson.

148
07:19.720 --> 07:21.079
Since childhood, Grandfather

149
07:21.300 --> 07:23.000
and the family have had high hopes for me.

150
07:24.240 --> 07:25.879
I was always pushed forward,

151
07:26.839 --> 07:29.639
thinking only of getting ahead.

152
07:30.360 --> 07:32.279
It's rare to have some peaceful days

153
07:32.439 --> 07:34.160
to be still and ask

154
07:34.839 --> 07:35.439
myself

155
07:39.000 --> 07:40.360
which path I truly want to take,

156
07:42.439 --> 07:43.480
and which way to follow.

157
07:46.959 --> 07:48.399
Getting ahead,

158
07:48.872 --> 07:50.360
bringing glory to one's ancestors...

159
07:51.959 --> 07:53.079
What's wrong with that?

160
07:54.480 --> 07:56.439
Shouldn't a man seek rank and riches

161
07:56.792 --> 07:58.310
and win honors for his wife and sons?

162
08:01.040 --> 08:01.839
Jinqi.

163
08:06.439 --> 08:07.240
Jinqiao.

164
08:08.280 --> 08:09.790
I've found a great way to make money.

165
08:09.816 --> 08:11.350
I want to discuss it with you, Jinqi.

166
08:11.360 --> 08:13.360
Shaohui, help me think it through, too.

167
08:17.079 --> 08:17.920
What is it?

168
08:19.120 --> 08:20.319
All I need is a ship

169
08:20.480 --> 08:21.839
and a merchant license.

170
08:21.920 --> 08:23.759
I ship silk and porcelain from Jiangnan

171
08:23.879 --> 08:24.879
to Quanzhou,

172
08:24.880 --> 08:26.232
and make several times the profit.

173
08:26.639 --> 08:28.680
So if I put in a thousand taels,

174
08:28.839 --> 08:30.120
I'll make several thousand.

175
08:32.720 --> 08:33.759
Do you know

176
08:34.679 --> 08:37.279
who buys the silk and porcelain?

177
08:38.759 --> 08:39.919
Who cares who buys it?

178
08:39.919 --> 08:40.960
In business,

179
08:41.000 --> 08:42.480
all that matters is selling the goods.

180
08:43.080 --> 08:44.519
The court enforces a maritime ban.

181
08:44.919 --> 08:46.279
Apart from tribute missions,

182
08:46.639 --> 08:48.480
trade with foreigners is forbidden.

183
08:48.759 --> 08:50.879
The buyers who'd make you that profit

184
08:51.279 --> 08:52.879
are those very foreigners.

185
08:54.159 --> 08:54.960
Right.

186
08:55.720 --> 08:57.840
Fujian has few fields and rough terrain.

187
08:58.279 --> 09:00.440
People rely on Zhejiang and Guangdong,

188
09:00.759 --> 09:02.240
shipping rice in by sea,

189
09:02.440 --> 09:04.320
just to scrape by.

190
09:04.720 --> 09:06.720
Yet some take the risk

191
09:06.879 --> 09:08.559
of shipping silk and porcelain

192
09:08.559 --> 09:10.519
from Jiangnan to Quanzhou

193
09:11.720 --> 09:13.200
and selling it to foreigners in secret

194
09:13.519 --> 09:14.919
for many times the profit.

195
09:15.279 --> 09:16.399
But if caught,

196
09:17.080 --> 09:22.320
by law, a hundred strokes or beheading.

197
09:25.320 --> 09:26.159
This fortune...

198
09:27.759 --> 09:28.919
do you still want to make it?

199
09:30.559 --> 09:31.200
No.

200
09:31.399 --> 09:32.039
Not anymore.

201
09:33.159 --> 09:35.039
Jinqi, forget I said anything.

202
09:35.600 --> 09:36.399
I'm off.

203
09:40.799 --> 09:41.600
Jinqiao.

204
09:47.960 --> 09:49.039
Because I resigned,

205
09:50.240 --> 09:51.879
you lost your post.

206
09:53.720 --> 09:54.639
Do you blame me?

207
10:01.080 --> 10:02.240
I only got that post

208
10:02.240 --> 10:04.039
thanks to you in the first place.

209
10:04.039 --> 10:05.159
I wasn't capable enough

210
10:05.159 --> 10:05.960
to keep it.

211
10:06.080 --> 10:07.440
How is that your fault?

212
10:07.879 --> 10:10.039
Jinqi, you've never called me useless,

213
10:10.159 --> 10:12.080
so how could I blame you?

214
10:13.919 --> 10:14.360
Jinqi,

215
10:15.559 --> 10:16.919
don't overthink it.

216
10:19.120 --> 10:20.080
I'm meeting a friend.

217
10:30.720 --> 10:31.879
Jinqiao has a pure heart.

218
10:32.879 --> 10:33.879
Having a brother like him

219
10:34.279 --> 10:35.399
is a blessing for you and me.

220
10:40.440 --> 10:41.440
In the past,

221
10:41.528 --> 10:42.550
I could have found Jinqiao

222
10:42.559 --> 10:44.120
a post in the army.

223
10:45.120 --> 10:47.480
But now, troops are cut everywhere.

224
10:48.440 --> 10:50.519
Don't worry about Jinqiao's post.

225
10:51.440 --> 10:52.919
He won't starve anytime soon.

226
10:56.039 --> 10:57.720
As long as not having a son

227
10:58.879 --> 11:00.120
doesn't make you resent Xiuru,

228
11:03.039 --> 11:04.200
Jinqiao and I

229
11:06.440 --> 11:07.840
will be content.

230
11:12.840 --> 11:13.480
Fengtai.

231
11:14.320 --> 11:15.440
I told you before,

232
11:15.550 --> 11:17.096
it was because I valued your character

233
11:17.159 --> 11:19.279
that I sought to join our two families.

234
11:20.240 --> 11:22.039
How could I ever break my word?

235
11:26.919 --> 11:28.279
Besides, Xiuru is still young.

236
11:28.936 --> 11:30.390
She'll have a son sooner or later.

237
11:35.240 --> 11:37.240
"You're still young,

238
11:37.399 --> 11:39.080
and a son will come sooner or later?"

239
11:39.559 --> 11:41.679
Stop trying to fool me!

240
11:45.000 --> 11:46.440
You're thirty-nine,

241
11:47.080 --> 11:49.480
nearly forty.

242
11:50.320 --> 11:52.480
She's twenty-six

243
11:52.919 --> 11:55.720
and had three useless girls in a row.

244
11:57.240 --> 12:00.240
Must I go to my grave

245
12:00.240 --> 12:03.440
still longing for a grandson?

246
12:05.679 --> 12:07.200
Mother, don't make yourself ill.

247
12:10.440 --> 12:11.480
Mother, please calm down.

248
12:11.480 --> 12:12.720
Have some water for your throat.

249
12:16.159 --> 12:17.519
It's all my fault.

250
12:17.720 --> 12:19.919
If you know you're at fault,

251
12:21.159 --> 12:22.200
have you considered

252
12:23.200 --> 12:24.279
what you should do

253
12:24.799 --> 12:28.039
as a wife of the Marquis's house?

254
12:28.879 --> 12:29.840
I don't know.

255
12:30.679 --> 12:32.000
Please guide me, Mother.

256
12:32.559 --> 12:34.720
Since you can't give him a son,

257
12:35.360 --> 12:36.279
you should

258
12:36.559 --> 12:38.399
find your husband a concubine soon

259
12:38.519 --> 12:39.879
so he'll have a son soon.

260
12:40.240 --> 12:43.200
That's what a virtuous wife does!

261
12:50.120 --> 12:51.679
Mother, I...

262
12:51.919 --> 12:52.519
Mother,

263
12:54.039 --> 12:55.480
give Xiuru one more chance.

264
12:55.864 --> 12:56.440
We'll surely...

265
12:56.440 --> 12:58.360
Must you drive me to my death

266
12:58.360 --> 13:00.039
before you'll agree?

267
13:00.039 --> 13:00.919
No, I...

268
13:01.840 --> 13:03.159
By court law,

269
13:04.919 --> 13:07.679
officials can't wed freeborn concubines.

270
13:08.279 --> 13:09.759
But women bought from outside

271
13:10.159 --> 13:11.480
have unknown backgrounds.

272
13:11.679 --> 13:12.840
I don't trust them.

273
13:13.559 --> 13:15.159
She must come from a clean background

274
13:15.639 --> 13:17.240
and have a gentle nature.

275
13:17.879 --> 13:19.399
After much thought,

276
13:20.759 --> 13:23.000
only Biwu is truly reliable.

277
13:25.220 --> 13:26.919
(Biwu, Old Madam Yuan's head maid, daughter of Yuan family's head butler)

278
13:26.919 --> 13:27.720
Mother!

279
13:29.720 --> 13:30.480
Biwu's father

280
13:31.279 --> 13:33.120
is our household's head butler.

281
13:33.559 --> 13:36.200
A fortune-teller cast Biwu's chart.

282
13:36.519 --> 13:39.480
She's fated to bear sons and bring luck.

283
13:40.639 --> 13:41.440
Mother!

284
13:43.919 --> 13:44.720
Blood?

285
13:45.519 --> 13:46.200
Mother!

286
13:47.440 --> 13:48.440
Rest for a while.

287
13:53.519 --> 13:54.360
You...

288
13:55.120 --> 13:56.360
Will you agree?

289
13:56.360 --> 13:57.039
I...

290
13:59.480 --> 14:02.799
Three days from now is a lucky day.

291
14:03.720 --> 14:06.840
We'll hold the concubine ceremony then!

292
14:08.519 --> 14:09.799
If I'm lucky,

293
14:10.080 --> 14:12.840
I may see a grandson before I die,

294
14:14.360 --> 14:15.679
and then peacefully

295
14:15.679 --> 14:18.480
go join your father below.

296
14:28.720 --> 14:29.639
I agree.

297
14:55.559 --> 14:57.720
Your Lordship, here's the medicine.

298
14:59.039 --> 14:59.840
I'll do it.

299
15:00.879 --> 15:02.559
Biwu, come.

300
16:17.120 --> 16:17.919
Mother.

301
16:20.600 --> 16:21.600
Silly child.

302
16:21.759 --> 16:23.120
I'm already soaked.

303
16:23.120 --> 16:24.720
Don't get yourself wet too.

304
16:42.200 --> 16:43.799
Even if not for yourself,

305
16:44.679 --> 16:46.279
then for me and my three sisters,

306
16:46.480 --> 16:48.879
you mustn't put your body through this.

307
16:51.039 --> 16:52.279
You're right, Jiarong.

308
16:53.240 --> 16:54.440
I was wrong.

309
16:56.720 --> 16:58.720
Ever since you married into this family,

310
16:59.320 --> 17:00.480
you've given your all

311
17:00.888 --> 17:02.000
serving your mother-in-law

312
17:02.519 --> 17:04.079
and treated me like your own daughter.

313
17:04.519 --> 17:06.559
You've never done a single thing wrong.

314
17:08.079 --> 17:10.119
What Third Granduncle and his kin plot,

315
17:11.279 --> 17:13.680
Grandmother may be too blind to see,

316
17:13.960 --> 17:15.559
but I see it all clearly.

317
17:16.279 --> 17:17.480
If Biwu's son

318
17:18.079 --> 17:19.400
inherits the title,

319
17:21.160 --> 17:22.759
this Yuan household

320
17:23.559 --> 17:25.519
will fall to Third Granduncle's family.

321
17:26.079 --> 17:28.599
What place would be left for us sisters?

322
17:36.839 --> 17:38.079
It's my fault.

323
17:39.000 --> 17:39.759
It's all because I

324
17:40.160 --> 17:41.319
couldn't bear a son.

325
17:42.720 --> 17:43.920
Not only has the Marquis

326
17:43.920 --> 17:45.599
been branded unfilial,

327
17:46.559 --> 17:49.039
but you girls have no one to rely on.

328
17:49.119 --> 17:50.640
How can that be your fault?

329
17:51.599 --> 17:53.000
It's Heaven's fault.

330
17:54.279 --> 17:56.680
Why can't a daughter inherit the title?

331
18:05.000 --> 18:06.119
You always say

332
18:06.319 --> 18:07.799
Grandmother is shrewd and capable,

333
18:08.519 --> 18:10.279
and Aunt Lanxiang is wise and gracious.

334
18:10.728 --> 18:12.240
Why don't we go to the Lin Residence

335
18:12.400 --> 18:15.079
and ask them to think of something?

336
18:21.820 --> 18:25.020
(Banyan Terrace and Gracious Shade)

337
18:26.680 --> 18:28.359
When Jiaming was born,

338
18:28.960 --> 18:30.119
I reminded you

339
18:30.440 --> 18:32.279
to find the Marquis a concubine.

340
18:33.319 --> 18:35.480
But you held too dear the love you shared

341
18:35.480 --> 18:36.720
and would not give him up.

342
18:37.480 --> 18:39.720
You claimed the Marquis said

343
18:40.039 --> 18:41.079
court officials

344
18:41.160 --> 18:43.279
must be sonless at forty to take one.

345
18:43.839 --> 18:45.119
Didn't you stop to think

346
18:45.240 --> 18:47.839
how few officials really keep that rule?

347
18:49.559 --> 18:50.720
And now look.

348
18:51.440 --> 18:53.599
The Yuan clan has you by the throat.

349
18:54.079 --> 18:55.559
Your mother-in-law resents you,

350
18:55.880 --> 18:57.720
and you're called a jealous wife.

351
18:57.960 --> 18:59.799
We can't blame the Third Young Lady.

352
19:00.720 --> 19:02.599
We were all young once.

353
19:02.960 --> 19:04.599
Who hasn't had her illusions,

354
19:06.880 --> 19:08.720
holding such paltry love

355
19:09.039 --> 19:10.720
dearer than all the world?

356
19:18.119 --> 19:19.519
Not one man is any good.

357
19:21.279 --> 19:22.319
You're an unmarried girl.

358
19:22.319 --> 19:23.359
What are you doing here?

359
19:23.519 --> 19:24.799
This isn't for your ears.

360
19:24.960 --> 19:25.720
Get out, now.

361
19:25.759 --> 19:26.759
Why can't I listen?

362
19:27.519 --> 19:28.240
These things

363
19:28.599 --> 19:30.440
should be made clear to a woman

364
19:30.519 --> 19:31.759
before she marries,

365
19:31.832 --> 19:33.440
so she doesn't reach her husband's home

366
19:33.799 --> 19:34.839
still clueless.

367
19:35.640 --> 19:37.039
With that wild temper of yours,

368
19:37.119 --> 19:38.359
no one will marry you.

369
19:38.519 --> 19:39.400
Listening is pointless.

370
19:39.640 --> 19:40.559
Go back, now.

371
19:40.648 --> 19:41.960
All the better if no one does.

372
19:43.119 --> 19:43.839
See?

373
19:49.960 --> 19:50.640
Xiuru.

374
19:51.559 --> 19:52.480
What do you

375
19:53.000 --> 19:54.200
really want?

376
19:57.559 --> 19:57.960
I...

377
20:00.839 --> 20:01.400
I...

378
20:02.519 --> 20:04.480
You have to tell us the truth

379
20:04.880 --> 20:06.720
so we can help you find a way.

380
20:08.279 --> 20:09.119
Xiuru,

381
20:09.480 --> 20:10.880
speak freely.

382
20:17.119 --> 20:19.720
I don't want him taking a concubine.

383
20:29.119 --> 20:30.519
Forgive me, I'm powerless.

384
20:30.880 --> 20:32.000
However capable I may be,

385
20:32.279 --> 20:34.519
I can't help you end the Yuan bloodline.

386
20:35.880 --> 20:36.359
You'll have

387
20:36.759 --> 20:37.960
to manage on your own.

388
20:39.559 --> 20:40.359
Shunhua.

389
20:41.039 --> 20:41.839
Shunhua.

390
20:41.960 --> 20:42.759
Shunhua.

391
20:44.920 --> 20:45.720
Shunhua.

392
20:46.350 --> 20:47.688
The Third Young Lady's troubles...

393
20:47.784 --> 20:49.096
are you really staying out of it?

394
20:50.920 --> 20:51.720
Shunhua.

395
20:52.720 --> 20:53.880
I knew it.

396
20:54.519 --> 20:56.119
What we women truly want

397
20:56.119 --> 20:57.720
counts for nothing.

398
20:58.279 --> 20:59.640
When family interests are at stake,

399
20:59.920 --> 21:01.599
who cares whether we women are happy

400
21:01.599 --> 21:02.519
or willing?

401
21:03.319 --> 21:05.039
I should never have said it.

402
21:05.440 --> 21:07.880
Now I've angered Mother as well.

403
21:10.079 --> 21:11.880
You're too heartless.

404
21:16.119 --> 21:17.359
Xiuru, don't cry.

405
21:19.799 --> 21:20.599
Lanxiang.

406
21:26.680 --> 21:27.480
Lanxiang.

407
21:29.000 --> 21:30.240
Please think of something

408
21:30.680 --> 21:31.880
to help Xiuru.

409
21:35.720 --> 21:37.119
Xiuru, don't cry.

410
21:49.440 --> 21:50.279
Stop crying.

411
21:53.240 --> 21:54.079
Stop crying.

412
21:57.440 --> 21:58.400
I said stop crying.

413
21:58.400 --> 21:59.160
Did you hear me?

414
22:05.039 --> 22:05.759
Xiuru,

415
22:06.839 --> 22:08.319
listen to what Lanxiang has to say.

416
22:10.119 --> 22:12.480
Yes, listen to Lanxiang.

417
22:22.119 --> 22:23.000
Xiuru.

418
22:23.720 --> 22:25.640
If you don't want Shaohui to take a concubine,

419
22:26.319 --> 22:28.599
there's only one way now.

420
22:29.559 --> 22:30.640
What way?

421
22:32.440 --> 22:33.319
If Shaohui

422
22:33.319 --> 22:35.319
insists on doing as Old Madam Yuan says

423
22:35.640 --> 22:36.920
and taking Biwu as a concubine,

424
22:37.839 --> 22:38.960
then separate from him.

425
22:45.440 --> 22:46.279
I agree.

426
22:47.279 --> 22:47.960
No.

427
22:49.200 --> 22:49.920
No.

428
22:51.799 --> 22:53.440
Shaohui only wants a concubine,

429
22:53.680 --> 22:55.240
and it's for the sake of an heir.

430
22:56.319 --> 22:57.759
Why go as far as separating?

431
22:58.279 --> 23:00.039
Besides, there are three children.

432
23:01.039 --> 23:02.400
If one day they learned

433
23:02.632 --> 23:04.330
that their mother, over so small a thing,

434
23:04.344 --> 23:05.200
had abandoned them,

435
23:05.680 --> 23:07.319
how could they bear it?

436
23:10.240 --> 23:11.680
Xiulai has a point.

437
23:12.720 --> 23:14.559
The Marquis's house is full of gossip.

438
23:15.319 --> 23:17.640
Children without a mother have it hard.

439
23:23.279 --> 23:24.519
What do you think, Xiuru?

440
23:35.279 --> 23:36.519
I'm too narrow-minded

441
23:37.839 --> 23:39.720
to be as generous as Mother wants.

442
23:41.160 --> 23:42.480
Rather than suffer day after day,

443
23:43.319 --> 23:44.839
it's better to end it quickly.

444
23:45.960 --> 23:47.119
I'd rather separate.

445
23:48.640 --> 23:49.319
All right.

446
23:50.640 --> 23:52.240
Since you've made up your mind,

447
23:53.119 --> 23:54.160
leave the rest

448
23:55.000 --> 23:56.640
to Jinqi and me.

449
23:58.880 --> 24:01.680
Jinqi and the Marquis are close friends.

450
24:02.359 --> 24:05.119
Would he truly quarrel with him for me?

451
24:06.160 --> 24:07.079
He would.

452
24:10.720 --> 24:12.920
My mother is gravely ill. Her days are few.

453
24:14.119 --> 24:15.119
Her only wish

454
24:15.920 --> 24:17.079
is to hold a grandson.

455
24:18.240 --> 24:19.240
As her son,

456
24:19.720 --> 24:20.952
I have no choice but to obey.

457
24:22.480 --> 24:24.079
I hope you'll understand, Jinqi.

458
24:28.279 --> 24:29.079
I understand.

459
24:32.319 --> 24:33.400
But Xiuru

460
24:34.552 --> 24:36.296
would rather end it with her pride intact

461
24:37.000 --> 24:38.350
than stay married by giving in.

462
24:40.260 --> 24:42.500
(Separation Agreement)

463
24:42.599 --> 24:43.359
Separation?

464
24:45.359 --> 24:46.559
This is absurd.

465
24:49.279 --> 24:49.960
I won't agree.

466
24:56.720 --> 24:58.240
Xiuru has made up her mind.

467
24:58.839 --> 25:00.079
Please grant her wish, Chengze.

468
25:01.079 --> 25:01.799
Old Madam.

469
25:06.519 --> 25:07.319
Mother.

470
25:07.519 --> 25:08.240
Aunt.

471
25:08.759 --> 25:10.759
So the Lin family wants a separation?

472
25:11.519 --> 25:12.000
Yes.

473
25:13.599 --> 25:14.400
Lin Jinqi.

474
25:15.039 --> 25:17.319
You're a marquis with no real power,

475
25:17.759 --> 25:19.680
and your heirs have yet to inherit.

476
25:20.200 --> 25:21.240
Where does the Lin family

477
25:21.559 --> 25:23.720
get the nerve to cross the Yuan family?

478
25:24.519 --> 25:25.599
We're not making trouble.

479
25:25.928 --> 25:27.400
I've invited the neighborhood headman,

480
25:27.410 --> 25:29.880
officials from the Ministry of War and the Ministry of Justice

481
25:30.119 --> 25:31.640
to officiate the separation.

482
25:32.296 --> 25:33.790
If that's not making trouble, what is?

483
25:34.088 --> 25:36.280
(Huang Mainiang, wife) Who invites the Ministry of War

484
25:36.350 --> 25:38.264
(of the late Marquis Yuan's cousin) and Justice to officiate a separation?

485
25:40.000 --> 25:40.640
Third Aunt.

486
25:41.519 --> 25:43.319
My wife is a titled marchioness.

487
25:43.799 --> 25:44.640
By court law,

488
25:44.792 --> 25:46.456
any officer's titled wife who separates

489
25:46.472 --> 25:48.200
must report to the Ministry of War

490
25:48.264 --> 25:49.624
and the Ministry of Justice

491
25:50.039 --> 25:50.839
for approval.

492
25:51.160 --> 25:52.759
It was thanks to the Yuan family

493
25:53.119 --> 25:54.799
that she got that title at all.

494
25:55.079 --> 25:57.400
And now that Lin woman flaunts her title

495
25:57.440 --> 25:59.720
to make this the talk of the whole city,

496
26:00.000 --> 26:01.720
bringing shame on the Yuan family.

497
26:09.119 --> 26:09.799
Old Madam Yuan,

498
26:10.519 --> 26:11.519
I'll take my leave.

499
26:13.559 --> 26:14.039
Fengtai.

500
26:15.200 --> 26:15.680
Fengtai.

501
26:16.759 --> 26:17.240
Fengtai.

502
26:23.384 --> 26:24.750
Third Aunt, you know full well

503
26:25.160 --> 26:27.200
His Majesty used my wedding to Xiuru

504
26:27.200 --> 26:28.440
as cover to leave Jinling.

505
26:28.616 --> 26:30.200
Fengtai risked his life to protect him

506
26:30.200 --> 26:32.119
and get him safely back to the capital.

507
26:32.488 --> 26:33.880
How can you ignore your conscience

508
26:33.880 --> 26:35.240
and say such nonsense?

509
26:35.960 --> 26:38.680
That title, the Lins earned themselves.

510
26:42.119 --> 26:43.880
Marrying into the Lins was a mistake.

511
26:44.680 --> 26:46.680
A humble house with small-minded ways.

512
26:47.519 --> 26:48.599
Separate, then.

513
26:49.119 --> 26:50.519
The Yuans have no shortage of wives.

514
26:50.519 --> 26:51.519
They can't separate.

515
26:51.960 --> 26:53.119
Absolutely not.

516
26:55.079 --> 26:57.039
If they separate over a concubine,

517
26:57.039 --> 26:59.319
that jealous Lin woman will fare badly,

518
26:59.680 --> 27:02.160
and our family's name will suffer too.

519
27:03.240 --> 27:04.319
How could that be possible?

520
27:05.272 --> 27:07.224
Every official at court knows that His Majesty

521
27:07.400 --> 27:10.440
only ascended the throne safely with Lin family's help during the wedding.

522
27:10.952 --> 27:11.750
The Lin family also

523
27:11.760 --> 27:13.960
rendered meritorious service in protecting His Majesty.

524
27:14.519 --> 27:15.920
After marrying into our family,

525
27:16.000 --> 27:17.920
she bore three daughters in succession.

526
27:18.088 --> 27:20.664
Even if she earned no merit, she still endured years of hardship.

527
27:21.519 --> 27:24.559
Now their marriage has fallen apart over a concubine.

528
27:25.640 --> 27:28.799
Our Yuan family will surely face criticism and attacks.

529
27:30.039 --> 27:31.079
When that happens, my son

530
27:32.296 --> 27:33.960
will not only have difficulty remarrying,

531
27:34.880 --> 27:37.440
but his official career may also be affected.

532
27:46.200 --> 27:47.920
Your Lordship, Old Madam.

533
27:47.960 --> 27:49.590
A group of officials has arrived outside.

534
27:49.799 --> 27:51.240
(Steward Fu, head steward) They say Marquis Jing'an invited them

535
27:51.336 --> 27:52.584
(of the Yuan Residence, Biwu's father) to preside over the separation

536
27:52.590 --> 27:53.830
of Your Lordship and the marchioness.

537
27:54.456 --> 27:56.480
Quite a few people have gathered outside to watch.

538
27:56.559 --> 27:57.000
I...

539
27:57.440 --> 27:58.279
I had no choice.

540
27:58.440 --> 28:00.552
I could only invite them into the residence first.

541
28:01.640 --> 28:02.880
I thought Lin

542
28:03.240 --> 28:05.000
was merely putting on a show to frighten us.

543
28:05.192 --> 28:07.160
I never expected her to truly seek a separation.

544
28:08.039 --> 28:10.359
Old Madam, what are we going to do?

545
28:16.140 --> 28:18.780
(Jiaxi Tower, Marquis Yongchang's Residence)

546
28:33.960 --> 28:36.160
Since both families have decided on a separation,

547
28:38.000 --> 28:38.880
this is

548
28:39.599 --> 28:41.200
the Lin family's Separation Agreement.

549
28:41.440 --> 28:43.519
Your Lordship, please take a look.

550
28:43.670 --> 28:45.540
(Separation Agreement) If everything is in order,

551
28:45.559 --> 28:46.519
please sign it.

552
28:46.520 --> 28:47.350
(Separation Agreement)

553
28:55.208 --> 28:57.830
I will no longer have the good fortune to serve you, Old Madam.

554
28:58.880 --> 29:01.599
I wish you good health

555
29:02.359 --> 29:03.519
and a long life.

556
29:15.599 --> 29:17.000
Third Young Lady

557
29:17.200 --> 29:19.599
truly loves Your Lordship with all her heart.

558
29:21.039 --> 29:21.599
Tell me,

559
29:22.640 --> 29:24.480
how did things ever come to this?

560
29:24.759 --> 29:27.200
How did things come to this?

561
29:32.160 --> 29:33.359
Old Madam Yuan,

562
29:33.359 --> 29:35.039
my heart

563
29:36.119 --> 29:38.480
feels as if it's being cut with a knife.

564
29:39.720 --> 29:43.200
How did things really come to this?

565
29:46.024 --> 29:47.310
Must the Yuan and Lin families

566
29:48.759 --> 29:50.440
really come to this?

567
29:51.448 --> 29:52.440
We follow different ways.

568
29:53.480 --> 29:54.920
It's better to part in peace

569
29:55.720 --> 29:56.960
and each seek our own path.

570
29:57.559 --> 29:58.960
You make it sound so easy.

571
30:00.599 --> 30:02.960
Today, in front of everyone, let me ask you this.

572
30:03.119 --> 30:04.200
If one day

573
30:05.480 --> 30:07.079
you're nearly forty,

574
30:07.720 --> 30:09.400
Lanxiang still has no son,

575
30:09.839 --> 30:11.920
and there's no heir to the title of Marquis Jing'an,

576
30:12.599 --> 30:13.880
will you still be able

577
30:14.280 --> 30:15.590
to refuse to take a concubine?

578
30:28.319 --> 30:29.400
I stubbornly insisted

579
30:30.360 --> 30:32.110
on helping Xiulai separate from her husband,

580
30:33.272 --> 30:35.720
and my wife helped me bring her out of the inner residence.

581
30:38.319 --> 30:39.240
In the heavy snow,

582
30:40.830 --> 30:42.184
when I was on the verge of death,

583
30:43.440 --> 30:45.000
my wife never left my side.

584
30:46.079 --> 30:47.519
In the bitter cold,

585
30:48.359 --> 30:50.920
she stayed with me through an entire day and night

586
30:53.599 --> 30:55.160
and even saved the whole Lin family.

587
30:56.480 --> 30:57.920
My wife has shown me kindness,

588
30:58.839 --> 30:59.680
loyalty,

589
31:00.519 --> 31:01.440
and love.

590
31:02.839 --> 31:05.400
If I betrayed her for the sake of a son

591
31:05.400 --> 31:06.480
I've never even met,

592
31:08.720 --> 31:10.119
what kind of man would I be?

593
31:12.000 --> 31:13.880
Even if I never have a son,

594
31:14.400 --> 31:17.240
then I must have offended Heaven in my previous life

595
31:17.359 --> 31:19.440
and made my wife suffer alongside me.

596
31:23.559 --> 31:26.480
You risked your life for that marquis title.

597
31:28.000 --> 31:28.920
You'd give it up?

598
31:34.039 --> 31:35.599
Marquis Yuan, you're mistaken.

599
31:39.720 --> 31:40.440
That title

600
31:41.799 --> 31:45.079
was won with both my wife's life and mine on the line.

601
31:46.079 --> 31:47.400
Passing it down to our descendants

602
31:47.880 --> 31:50.880
isn't so they can live off their ancestors' achievements,

603
31:51.119 --> 31:52.359
but so they can

604
31:52.359 --> 31:55.279
remember their ancestors' glory and strive to better themselves.

605
31:56.960 --> 31:59.519
If my wife and I never have a son,

606
32:01.200 --> 32:02.559
then we'll return the title

607
32:04.039 --> 32:05.440
to the court.

608
32:13.880 --> 32:15.119
How did things

609
32:15.519 --> 32:18.160
really come to this?

610
32:19.119 --> 32:20.200
My dear sister.

611
32:23.608 --> 32:25.064
- First Madam. - First Madam.

612
32:26.880 --> 32:27.680
Shunhua.

613
32:33.519 --> 32:34.440
My dear sister.

614
32:34.720 --> 32:36.240
This is all my fault.

615
32:36.392 --> 32:37.750
I said it in the heat of the moment

616
32:37.944 --> 32:39.510
and said I wouldn't interfere anymore.

617
32:39.880 --> 32:41.440
I never imagined these youngsters

618
32:41.759 --> 32:43.039
would be so bold

619
32:43.400 --> 32:44.960
as to turn a private family matter

620
32:44.960 --> 32:46.599
into the talk of the entire city.

621
32:46.680 --> 32:47.680
This is outrageous!

622
32:49.039 --> 32:51.160
You couldn't have come at a better time.

623
32:51.880 --> 32:53.559
Please talk some sense into Xiuru.

624
32:53.799 --> 32:54.839
What married couple

625
32:54.839 --> 32:56.799
separates over a concubine?

626
32:57.119 --> 32:58.039
Exactly.

627
32:58.599 --> 32:59.599
What married couple

628
32:59.599 --> 33:01.160
separates because of a concubine?

629
33:01.160 --> 33:01.720
Exactly.

630
33:02.039 --> 33:03.960
Once word gets out, everyone will think

631
33:04.039 --> 33:06.279
the Yuan family did something disgraceful

632
33:06.680 --> 33:07.920
that drove a mother

633
33:08.184 --> 33:10.310
to seek a separation despite having four daughters.

634
33:16.296 --> 33:17.830
What nonsense are you talking about?

635
33:23.799 --> 33:25.599
I am Marquis Yongchang's mother-in-law,

636
33:25.880 --> 33:26.880
and by imperial decree,

637
33:26.880 --> 33:28.856
I hold the court-conferred title of marchioness.

638
33:29.920 --> 33:30.759
May I ask

639
33:31.119 --> 33:32.359
who exactly this woman is

640
33:32.519 --> 33:34.039
speaking so harshly and berating me?

641
33:36.839 --> 33:38.720
She's the wife of the old Marquis's cousin.

642
33:42.400 --> 33:43.240
My dear sister,

643
33:43.839 --> 33:46.079
let's speak in private.

644
33:46.359 --> 33:47.799
Have them leave us.

645
33:51.000 --> 33:52.200
All of you, go outside for now.

646
34:09.440 --> 34:10.320
Go!

647
34:22.920 --> 34:23.840
My dear sister,

648
34:24.239 --> 34:26.000
I'm a straightforward person,

649
34:26.280 --> 34:28.079
so I'll speak plainly.

650
34:29.159 --> 34:32.199
If you want me to persuade Xiuru to change her mind,

651
34:32.719 --> 34:34.519
you'll have to agree to a few conditions.

652
34:36.199 --> 34:36.920
Go ahead.

653
34:37.760 --> 34:38.199
First,

654
34:38.840 --> 34:39.880
he may take a concubine,

655
34:40.519 --> 34:43.360
but she must be chosen by the Lin family.

656
34:48.119 --> 34:49.000
My dear sister,

657
34:49.599 --> 34:51.039
what you want is a grandson.

658
34:51.079 --> 34:53.360
Why should it matter which woman gives birth to him?

659
34:53.928 --> 34:56.480
If wife and concubine get along, the household will be at peace,

660
34:56.559 --> 34:59.239
and my third son-in-law can focus on his duties.

661
34:59.880 --> 35:01.119
If they don't get along

662
35:01.240 --> 35:02.840
and there's trouble like this every day,

663
35:02.872 --> 35:04.936
with Ministry of War officials showing up one moment

664
35:04.952 --> 35:06.664
and Ministry of Justice officials the next,

665
35:06.760 --> 35:07.639
my third son-in-law

666
35:08.920 --> 35:10.679
may not be able to take much more of it.

667
35:19.039 --> 35:19.400
Fine.

668
35:20.199 --> 35:21.199
I agree.

669
35:22.079 --> 35:24.079
The Lin family can choose the concubine.

670
35:28.559 --> 35:29.199
Second,

671
35:30.719 --> 35:32.079
the Marquis's family property

672
35:32.248 --> 35:35.070
may only be divided equally among the children of his principal wife.

673
35:36.199 --> 35:36.559
You...

674
35:38.880 --> 35:40.039
You mean

675
35:40.920 --> 35:42.239
only Jiarong

676
35:42.639 --> 35:44.840
and Lin's daughters can inherit the family property?

677
35:46.480 --> 35:49.360
The principal wife now has four daughters.

678
35:49.800 --> 35:51.000
You're right, my dear sister.

679
35:51.032 --> 35:52.940
Then the four daughters will divide it equally.

680
35:53.400 --> 35:54.639
After all, you want a grandson

681
35:55.000 --> 35:56.719
to inherit the marquis title.

682
35:57.320 --> 35:58.800
He'll already have the title.

683
35:58.810 --> 36:01.330
Why should he compete with his sisters for the family property?

684
36:02.119 --> 36:03.599
What if I refuse?

685
36:06.639 --> 36:08.239
Even if I agree,

686
36:08.559 --> 36:10.519
my eldest son won't.

687
36:11.280 --> 36:12.599
He's a real firecracker.

688
36:12.728 --> 36:15.420
He was the one who urged Xiulai to separate from her husband before.

689
36:15.519 --> 36:17.719
The case even went to Shuntian Prefecture

690
36:17.840 --> 36:19.400
and drew His Majesty's attention.

691
36:19.920 --> 36:21.599
I simply can't control him.

692
36:22.320 --> 36:23.079
Aren't you afraid

693
36:23.080 --> 36:25.352
the reputation of the Lin family's daughters will suffer

694
36:25.544 --> 36:27.720
and make it difficult for them to marry in the future?

695
36:30.480 --> 36:32.559
My own daughter is already married.

696
36:33.119 --> 36:34.239
As for the others,

697
36:36.760 --> 36:38.400
I have enough troubles of my own.

698
36:38.480 --> 36:40.600
I can't worry about what happens to everyone else.

699
36:41.719 --> 36:44.679
Your Lin family has gone too far.

700
36:54.000 --> 36:56.440
Old Madam Yuan, you have a broad forehead

701
36:56.880 --> 36:58.079
and full earlobes.

702
36:58.312 --> 37:00.230
Those features promise many blessed descendants.

703
37:00.328 --> 37:02.280
I'm sure you'll have more than one grandson.

704
37:03.880 --> 37:05.239
Xiuru is still young.

705
37:05.840 --> 37:07.599
She may well have a son in the future.

706
37:08.920 --> 37:11.980
Since the principal wife's children will divide the family property equally,

707
37:12.199 --> 37:14.440
a son would naturally receive his share as well.

708
37:19.760 --> 37:21.280
Search your conscience and tell me,

709
37:22.239 --> 37:24.280
how can there be such a rule

710
37:24.719 --> 37:27.079
that daughters inherit the family property?

711
37:27.512 --> 37:28.280
Old Madam Yuan,

712
37:28.328 --> 37:30.670
the idea that daughters cannot inherit family property

713
37:30.679 --> 37:32.119
has never been an unalterable rule

714
37:32.199 --> 37:33.679
since ancient times.

715
37:34.239 --> 37:35.199
During the Han dynasty,

716
37:35.240 --> 37:37.368
daughters could not only inherit family property,

717
37:37.599 --> 37:38.960
but even noble titles.

718
37:40.719 --> 37:42.000
How could that be possible?

719
37:42.360 --> 37:43.559
Why wouldn't it be?

720
37:44.719 --> 37:47.760
Even if you don't know there were titled noblewomen in the Han dynasty,

721
37:47.920 --> 37:48.679
surely you know

722
37:48.904 --> 37:50.776
there was a female emperor in the Tang dynasty.

723
37:51.320 --> 37:53.079
No matter how persuasively you put it,

724
37:53.599 --> 37:55.440
I cannot agree to let daughters

725
37:55.960 --> 37:57.190
inherit the family property.

726
37:57.639 --> 37:58.280
I agree.

727
38:18.760 --> 38:19.199
Mother.

728
38:20.159 --> 38:21.400
If the boy proves capable,

729
38:21.464 --> 38:23.112
he'll already have the marquis title.

730
38:23.400 --> 38:25.519
Building a fortune of his own won't be difficult.

731
38:26.159 --> 38:27.239
If he proves incapable,

732
38:27.760 --> 38:28.800
forget the family property.

733
38:29.199 --> 38:31.480
He may not even be able to keep the title.

734
38:31.976 --> 38:33.840
My daughters are my own flesh and blood, too,

735
38:34.072 --> 38:35.550
and they carry the Yuan bloodline.

736
38:36.728 --> 38:38.710
I'm willing to leave the family property to them

737
38:39.048 --> 38:40.800
so they can live their lives in security.

738
38:58.440 --> 38:59.239
My dear sister,

739
39:00.880 --> 39:04.280
no one can have everything go their way in life.

740
39:05.039 --> 39:08.079
Each side giving a little is already the best outcome.

741
39:08.960 --> 39:09.960
You get your grandson,

742
39:10.440 --> 39:11.800
and their family stays together.

743
39:15.119 --> 39:15.920
Why

744
39:16.519 --> 39:18.320
force a loving couple

745
39:18.320 --> 39:19.960
to be torn apart

746
39:20.648 --> 39:21.630
and leave the children

747
39:22.199 --> 39:23.440
without their mother?

748
39:33.920 --> 39:34.920
I'm old now.

749
39:36.712 --> 39:37.592
As for this matter,

750
39:38.480 --> 39:39.800
I'll leave the decision to you.

751
40:05.340 --> 40:10.820
♪Time unfurls a long scroll♪

752
40:11.416 --> 40:13.460
This is the document dividing the family property.

753
40:13.760 --> 40:14.840
Please take a look, Shaohui.

754
40:15.400 --> 40:16.480
If you have no objections,

755
40:16.648 --> 40:18.110
the neighborhood headman here

756
40:18.519 --> 40:19.760
can serve as your witness.

757
40:20.000 --> 40:21.000
Sign it.

758
40:21.000 --> 40:23.490
♪Through rise and fall, people meet and part as they always do♪

759
40:25.480 --> 40:26.039
All right.

760
40:26.039 --> 40:29.540
♪Each plant endures its own trials before reaching shore♪

761
40:29.780 --> 40:33.020
♪Bamboo shadows embrace quiet contentment♪

762
40:33.020 --> 40:36.060
♪Only orchids dwell in secluded places♪

763
40:36.420 --> 40:41.820
♪Watching the old and new take turns in this world♪

764
40:41.820 --> 40:46.519
(Spring Breeze Carries the Seasons)

765
40:46.519 --> 40:47.920
I've put you through a lot today.

766
40:50.376 --> 40:52.424
What you said today at the Yuan Residence

767
40:52.599 --> 40:54.039
in front of everyone...

768
40:55.768 --> 40:57.710
It may have come out in the heat of my exchange

769
40:57.840 --> 40:58.880
with Chengze,

770
40:59.320 --> 41:01.000
but I meant every word.

771
41:03.519 --> 41:04.760
I swear that in this life,

772
41:05.304 --> 41:06.710
I will never take a concubine.

773
41:07.559 --> 41:08.280
My only wish

774
41:09.599 --> 41:10.840
is to hold your hand

775
41:11.480 --> 41:12.519
and grow old with you.

776
41:19.519 --> 41:20.320
Careful.

777
41:20.320 --> 41:22.020
(All afflictions arise from ignorance)

778
41:28.152 --> 41:29.070
- Mother. - Mother.

779
41:29.960 --> 41:31.519
Shaohui has signed it?

780
41:32.679 --> 41:33.360
He's signed it.

781
41:38.599 --> 41:39.760
Have your wife

782
41:40.280 --> 41:41.440
sit down and join us.

783
41:42.719 --> 41:43.960
Thank you for the seat, Mother.

784
41:45.800 --> 41:46.280
Come.

785
41:57.639 --> 41:58.480
Tell me,

786
41:58.960 --> 42:00.719
when did you figure it out?

787
42:02.760 --> 42:05.400
I sensed something was strange from the very beginning that day,

788
42:05.719 --> 42:07.239
but I couldn't figure out why.

789
42:08.239 --> 42:10.000
Then Mother swept out in anger,

790
42:10.199 --> 42:11.320
and I understood.

791
42:11.840 --> 42:13.199
Mother wanted us

792
42:13.480 --> 42:14.800
to be Xiuru's blade

793
42:15.320 --> 42:16.880
and force the Yuan family to yield.

794
42:20.079 --> 42:22.079
You really are a clever one.

795
42:23.239 --> 42:24.719
Lanxiang and I talked it over.

796
42:25.079 --> 42:26.800
When Xiuru was still unmarried,

797
42:26.872 --> 42:29.500
she already had the courage to seek a better marriage for herself.

798
42:29.688 --> 42:31.880
She was never someone who would lose herself in love.

799
42:32.719 --> 42:35.719
What she feared wasn't Chengze taking a concubine,

800
42:36.159 --> 42:37.480
but the Yuan clansmen

801
42:37.624 --> 42:40.610
using a son born to a concubine to take control of the Marquis's household.

802
42:41.360 --> 42:42.679
Then Xiuru and her daughters

803
42:42.800 --> 42:44.880
would be left at the mercy of others,

804
42:44.920 --> 42:47.890
forced to watch their every expression and tread carefully just to survive.

805
42:48.360 --> 42:50.960
I knew Xiuru understood what was at stake,

806
42:51.760 --> 42:53.679
so I showed her a way forward.

807
42:56.440 --> 42:57.079
You two

808
42:58.400 --> 43:00.760
shouldn't blame her for going to such lengths.

809
43:05.100 --> 43:07.580
=Against the Current= (Next Episode's Preview)

810
43:08.159 --> 43:09.360
Fainted! Unconscious now!

811
43:09.960 --> 43:10.599
Come here!

812
43:10.760 --> 43:11.840
Hurry over here!

813
43:11.880 --> 43:12.400
Come on!

814
43:12.840 --> 43:14.159
Quick, press the philtrum!

815
43:14.480 --> 43:14.920
Over here!

816
43:16.440 --> 43:17.320
Quick, come here!

817
43:17.639 --> 43:18.880
Hurry over here!

818
43:25.300 --> 43:27.770
- Mother and daughter are safe! - Mother and daughter are safe!

819
43:27.784 --> 43:29.360
Wonderful!

820
43:29.360 --> 43:32.400
- Mother and daughter are safe! - Mother and daughter are safe!

821
43:32.400 --> 43:33.144
The baby's born!

822
43:50.380 --> 43:54.500
♪Spring slips from the branches once more♪

823
43:57.340 --> 44:01.860
♪Flowers bloom unseen, as they have before♪

824
44:03.140 --> 44:07.060
♪All the joys and sorrows come and go♪

825
44:07.740 --> 44:10.500
♪While loss leaves winter in the heart♪

826
44:11.220 --> 44:13.540
♪Though all the world may fade♪

827
44:13.540 --> 44:16.620
♪Time rolls on as countless lives rush by♪

828
44:18.140 --> 44:22.380
♪Night winds wander through the halls of long ago♪

829
44:25.300 --> 44:29.460
♪No page could hold the longing words can never show♪

830
44:31.260 --> 44:34.820
♪Every joy and sorrow in this fleeting life♪

831
44:34.820 --> 44:38.380
♪Fades into the past as new wounds rise♪

832
44:39.180 --> 44:44.860
♪While whispers of perfume linger beneath the eaves♪

833
44:45.220 --> 44:49.540
♪Let the cold wind rage, let the wild rain fall♪

834
44:49.900 --> 44:52.860
♪Let sorrow spill like shadows over all♪

835
44:52.860 --> 44:56.620
♪Let love fall to pieces, let old anger burn away♪

836
44:56.620 --> 44:59.500
♪Let the past die with yesterday♪

837
44:59.500 --> 45:03.580
♪One last fire, one last cup of wine♪

838
45:03.580 --> 45:06.940
♪And silver moonlight to guide me through the night♪

839
45:06.940 --> 45:10.700
♪Let beginnings fade as endings come to call♪

840
45:10.700 --> 45:14.700
♪From this endless dream, there's no return at all♪

841
45:15.460 --> 45:19.620
♪Let the cold wind rage, let the wild rain fall♪

842
45:19.620 --> 45:23.060
♪Let sorrow spill like shadows over all♪

843
45:23.060 --> 45:26.700
♪Let love fall to pieces, let old anger burn away♪

844
45:26.700 --> 45:29.580
♪Let the past die with yesterday♪

845
45:29.580 --> 45:33.660
♪One last fire, one last cup of wine♪

846
45:33.660 --> 45:37.020
♪And silver moonlight to guide me through the night♪

847
45:37.020 --> 45:40.660
♪Let beginnings fade as endings come to call♪

848
45:40.660 --> 45:48.460
♪From this endless dream, there's no return at all♪
